OL,3,GNEWSA'People have been knitting and
OL,4,Acrocheting for the past year' -
OL,5,Acascading poppies for Remembrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany churches and communities across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland have been preparing
OL,9,Ffor Remembrance Sunday with
OL,10,Fcommemorations which invite people to
OL,11,Fstop and remember those who died in
OL,12,Fwar.
OL,14,FOn Sunday, services will take place in
OL,15,Fmemory of those killed in the two world
OL,16,Fwars and subsequent conflicts.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
