OL,3,GNEWSA'People have been knitting and
OL,4,Acrocheting for the past year' -
OL,5,Acascading poppies for Remembrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome of the largest ceremonies are at
OL,8,Fthe cenotaph in Belfast and in
OL,9,FEnniskillen, which is expected to be
OL,10,Fattended by the Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fsecretary and the taoiseach (Irish
OL,12,Fprime minister).
OL,14,FHundreds of smaller ceremonies will
OL,15,Ftake place in towns and villages, with
OL,16,Fpeople gathering at war memorials and
OL,17,Fjoining in two minutes of silence from
OL,18,F11:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
